{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20550","headline":"送令狐尚书赴东都留守 · 张籍","name":"送令狐尚书赴东都留守","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝廷重寄在关东，共说从前选上公。\n勳业新城大梁镇，恩荣更守洛阳宫。\n行香暂出天桥上，巡礼常过禁殿中。\n每领羣臣拜章庆，半开门仗日曈曈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20550.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20550","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}